silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_06_closure_concrete_anchor_2_Hom_profile#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode2 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode2 is the Hom-profile Hom(-,L_Mittens) concretely the family of typed arrows by which Mittens is queried, measured, owned, validated, and cited. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Hom_profile', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
